<h3 data-section-id="1av8atx" data-start="927" data-end="951"><span role="text">2. Ahora <code data-start="940" data-end="951">style.css</code></span></h3>
<p data-start="953" data-end="985">Busca el bloque que empieza con:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="987" data-end="1005"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="relative h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="select-none sticky z-2 top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-(--code-block-surface)"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-607cb53d.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>CSS</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copiar" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-607cb53d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span class="ͼ13">header</span><span>{</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1007" data-end="1034">y reemplázalo completo por:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1036" data-end="1815"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="relative h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="select-none sticky z-2 top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-(--code-block-surface)"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-607cb53d.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>CSS</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copiar" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-607cb53d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span class="ͼt">/* =========================
   ENCABEZADO CEMEX
========================= */</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼ13">header</span><span> {
    background: </span><span class="ͼy">white</span><span>;
    color: #003b75;
    text-align: </span><span class="ͼy">center</span><span>;
    box-shadow: </span><span class="ͼy">0</span><span> </span><span class="ͼy">4</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼy">15</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">rgba</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼy">0</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼy">0</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼy">0</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼy">.12</span><span>);
}

.</span><span class="ͼ10">barra-cemex</span><span> {
    height: </span><span class="ͼy">7</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span>;
    background: #d71920;
}

.</span><span class="ͼ10">encabezado-contenido</span><span> {
    min-height: </span><span class="ͼy">105</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span>;
    display: </span><span class="ͼy">flex</span><span>;
    justify-content: </span><span class="ͼy">center</span><span>;
    align-items: </span><span class="ͼy">center</span><span>;
    gap: </span><span class="ͼy">22</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span>;
    padding: </span><span class="ͼy">18</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼy">20</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼ10">logo-cemex</span><span> {
    width: </span><span class="ͼy">125</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span>;
    height: </span><span class="ͼy">auto</span><span>;
    object-fit: </span><span class="ͼy">contain</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼ10">titulo-sistema</span><span> {
    text-align: </span><span class="ͼy">left</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼ10">titulo-sistema</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ13">h1</span><span> {
    margin: </span><span class="ͼy">0</span><span>;
    color: #003b75;
    font-size: </span><span class="ͼy">30</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼ10">titulo-sistema</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ13">p</span><span> {
    margin-top: </span><span class="ͼy">5</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span>;
    color: #666;
    font-size: </span><span class="ͼy">14</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼ10">barra-inferior</span><span> {
